---
# Keep in sync with local pre-commit (and lasyten). Without this file, GitHub
# Actions' system clang-format defaults to LLVM and fails the dry-run.
# https://zed0.co.uk/clang-format-configurator/
BasedOnStyle: Mozilla
AlwaysBreakAfterReturnType: None
ColumnLimit: 99
IndentWidth: 4
Language: Cpp
TabWidth: 4
UseTab: Never
...
